1700 button LEFT_CENTER up
1900 tap NAV 60
2200 assert_view PROJECT
2300 tap LEFT_TOP 60
2600 marker transport
2700 button LEFT_CENTER down
2850 encoder_value NAV 0.01
3100 button LEFT_CENTER up
3300 assert_view PROJECT
